<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-FINAL RESULT IN HONG KONG'S SALEM OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FINAL RESULT IN HONG KONG'S SALEM OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final result in the US$328,000 Hong Kong Salem Open on Monday (prefix denotes seeding).</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (United States) beat 5-Patrick Rafter (Australia) 6-3 6-3 (Chang led 6-3 5-3 overnight after rain stopped play on Sunday)</p>
</text>
